From: yasoteien <263659156+yasoteien@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: Add a charger and fuel gauge driver for the RK818 (read only)

Add rk818_charger, the charger and fuel gauge of the Rockchip RK818
PMIC, written for the Pomera DM250. The register settings, the fuel
gauge units and the layout of the battery backed data registers follow
the vendor kernel of that device, so that both kernels can be booted
on one machine without upsetting each other's state of charge.

This first stage only reads; no register is written.

Signed-off-by: yasoteien <263659156+yasoteien@users.noreply.github.com>
---
diff -ruN a/drivers/mfd/rk8xx-core.c b/drivers/mfd/rk8xx-core.c
